  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amelioration de la gouvernance territoriale pour un acc s equitable et une utilisation durable de l`eau afin de promouvoir une culture de paix dans les regions de Gafsa et Kairouan. (APAISE-PBF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve local water governance in Tunisia, in order to ensure a transparent and equitable distribution of water resources, in the face of growing tensions due to their unequal management between the North and the South of the country. In response to climate challenges, including reduced rainfall and increased droughts, it promotes sustainable and efficient water use through appropriate techniques and a change in user behavior.</narrative>
  </description>
